	(text "Goals:\n- ESP32-C1 based\n- Support for a 24V LiFePo4 solar system in power and power measurement\n- Support on board for 0-2 power measurement channels\n- Support for an optional load cell measurement\n- Support for a micro-SD card for logging\nSecondary\n- Optional support for an LCD\n- Breakout remaining GPIO / comms channels"
